# G8: the mouse in graphics. Places are pixels of the 640 by 480 screen. Double click a word and type over it, click and Shift-click, drag
# across a line, triple click a paragraph, scroll with the wheel, then save and exit by key. Played on the host through quill-paint's
# shell and pointer, and into QUILLDOS.EXE from a QUILL_MOUSE file, so every frame's CRC-32 must be equal.
@copy letter.rtf
@open LETTER.RTF
@dclick 45 146
h e l l o
@click 20 166
@shiftclick 200 166
@drag 150 210 330 210
@tclick 120 259
@wheel 2
@wheel -2
@click 100 20
@click 3 296
f10 down down enter     # File > Save
f10 end enter           # File > Exit
